stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Registered: register original source and attempt
    Registered --> Pending: capture late native user rows and materialize evidence
    Pending --> Pending: Before has enqueue receipt only
    Pending --> Owned: complete census pairs original source and free attempt
    Pending --> Owned: exact native UUID receipt
    Owned --> Excluded: exclude input_notice_source
    Pending --> Direct: all matching attempts already occupied
    Direct --> Posted: prepare and first POST
    Direct --> FalseExcluded: BeforeKnown uses global frame knowledge
    state HTTP {
        [*] --> Received
        Received --> Accepted: start or deliver winner Ok
        Received --> Rejected: error or 409
        Accepted --> DurableEcho: enqueue once with durable identity
        DurableEcho --> Echoed: outbox transport recovers
        Accepted --> MissingEcho: AcceptanceGap crashes before enqueue
        Rejected --> MissingEcho: AcceptanceGap backend effect despite error
        Accepted --> Accepted: replay makes no enqueue attempt
        DurableEcho --> DurableEcho: restart preserves durable identity
    }
